{"task_id": "HumanEval/98", "solution": "def count_upper(s: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Count uppercase vowels (A, E, I, O, U) located at even indices (0\u2011based) in a string.\n\n    Parameters\n    ----------\n    s : str\n        Input string to be evaluated.\n\n    Returns\n    -------\n    int\n        Number of uppercase vowels found at even indices.\n\n    Examples\n    --------\n    >>> count_upper(\"AEIOU\")\n    5\n    >>> count_upper(\"aEiOu\")\n    1\n    >>> count_upper(\"A1E2I3O4U5\")\n    3\n    \"\"\"\n    UPPER_VOWELS = {'A', 'E', 'I', 'O', 'U'}\n    count = 0\n    for i in range(0, len(s), 2):\n        if s[i] in UPPER_VOWELS:\n            count += 1\n    return count"}
